     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>A couple of recent bug fixes have resolved issues with loading rattle projects and exporting PMML models.<br></div><div><br></div><div><p>To install the latest development Version 5.2.7 dated 2019-04-07: <br></p><p><br></p><pre>&gt; install.packages(&quot;rattle&quot;, repos=&quot;<a href=\"https://rattle.togaware.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rattle.togaware.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478121185000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2AgvNJMmhXZSha4_cXUiqY\">https://rattle.togaware.com</a>&quot;, type=&quot;source&quot;)\r\n<br><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\">The docker image for Rattle has also been updated to this latest version:</span> <span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>    <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/r/kayon/rattle\" title=\"https://hub.docker.com/r/kayon/mlhub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://hub.docker.com/r/kayon/rattle&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478121185000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3YSHqdPunHLTF1_xWnXw56\">https://hub.docker.com/r/kayon/rattle</a><br><br>My latest project is to create a repository of pre-built machine learning models (and more).<br>It is hosted on <a href=\"https://mlhub.ai\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mlhub.ai&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478121185000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1iwZNKX6ztKr104n8rVhgq\">https://mlhub.ai</a> and a docker image for it is also available as <br><br>    </span><span dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/r/kayon/mlhub\" title=\"https://hub.docker.com/r/kayon/mlhub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://hub.docker.com/r/kayon/mlhub&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478121185000&amp;usg=AOvVaw36x1aBPEl9z1QZvitO-rbG\">https: